{"n":65,"level":"A1","title":"Past questions with did","pt":"Perguntas no passado com did","scene":"newsroom","tod":"day","cast":["Amy","Pete","Pog"],"fic":{"scene":"newsroom","tod":"day","decor":[],"cast":[{"p":{"hs":"curly","outfit":"dress","top":"#4a90d9","hair":"blond","skin":"pale","arms":"wave"}},{"p":{"hs":"side","outfit":"shirt","top":"#e8473b","hair":"blond","skin":"light","arms":"point"}},{"p":{"hs":"spiky","outfit":"shirt","top":"#7b5cf0","hair":"blue","skin":"light","arms":"out"}}]},"minutes":64,"slides":[{"t":"cover","min":1,"title":"Past questions with did","pt":"Perguntas no passado com did","level":"A1","n":65,"cast":["Amy","Pete","Pog"]},{"t":"goals","min":1,"goal":"Perguntar sobre o passado de forma natural.","canDo":["Usar did + verbo","Responder Yes, I did / No, I didn't","Usar when, where, why no passado"]},{"t":"warm","min":2,"q":"Onde você foi nas últimas férias?","pt":"Colete respostas curtas.","chips":["Did you see the fire?","Yes, I did.","No, I didn't.","What happened?"]},{"t":"curious","min":1,"title":"Did + verbo base","text":"No passado, 'did' carrega o tempo, então o verbo volta à base: 'Did you see it?'. Não diga 'Did you saw?'. O mesmo vale para negativas: 'I didn't go'.","kind":"Você sabia?"},{"t":"scene","min":1,"text":"Amy, a repórter, entrevista Pete, o bombeiro, sobre o resgate de ontem.","line":"Pete, what happened yesterday?","who":["Amy","Pete","Pog"]},{"t":"article","min":2,"title":"The hero of the day","text":"Yesterday a fire started in the old factory near Maple Street. Pete and his team arrived in six minutes. They worked for four hours with long hoses and tall ladders. Nobody got hurt. \"Did you see the flames?\" asked a reporter. \"Yes, I did,\" said Pete. \"They were huge, but my team was fast.\" Today the newspaper has a photo of Pete on the front page. He says, \"We are only doing our job. The real heroes are the people who called for help.\"","pt":"Pete e sua equipe controlam um incêndio e aparecem no jornal.","qs"